 ## [Unreleased]
 
+- **Generate constructors without losing surrounding code.** Compact declarations and grouped properties retain neighboring members. Promotion preserves original native property types and documentation and requires PHP 8.0; documentation-only return types are not used as constructor parameter types. Contributed by PHP Workbench downstream.
+
 - **Keep generated accessors inside compact classes.** Getter and setter generation preserves following members and comments, including compact traits and readonly classes. Contributed by PHP Workbench downstream.
 
 - **Readonly-class accessors.** Getter generation remains available for readonly classes, while setter actions are omitted for their readonly properties. Contributed by PHP Workbench downstream.
